{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XeE5VrBOoJ1793260027.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超及官員見記者，交代宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告。律政司司長林定國指，政府同意獨立委員會建議，通過立法及修改現行法律，加強禁止並打擊樓宇維修工程圍標行為，將修改三條現行法例，包括修改競爭條例，將樓宇大型維修工程圍標行為列為刑事罪行。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203506-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E7%9B%A3%E7%AE%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E7%BD%B0%E5%89%87%E6%89%93%E6%93%8A%E5%9C%8D%E6%A8%99%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告｜改革樓宇維修監管　提升罰則打擊圍標｜全面改革‧一文看清</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:03.443292+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:22.200515+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:23.631915+00:00","content_hash":"213b8f3479eaea15c7368aff461a0ea490de01386e0185c597e2309c03dce520","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}